# Summit Leads CRM - Corrected Architecture Diagram
# Updated: May 18, 2026
#
# Fixes applied:
#   1. ai_call_summary now points to api-free-llm API
#   2. useDialerQueue connected to campaign_contacts, dispositions, power_dialer_next
#   3. power_dialer_next and predictive_dialer_engine fully connected
#   4. get_recording_url connected to recordings table and Supabase Storage
#   5. livekit_webhook connected to call_logs, webhook_events, ai_call_summary
#   6. call_monitor connected to call_monitoring_sessions
#   7. Sequence diagram: token fetched directly from edge function (no double-Supabase hop)
#   8. Post-call webhook + AI summary sequence added
#   9. Data flow: CSV Import → Contact (was reversed); Manual Entry path added
#  10. DNC check gate added between Queue and Call
#  11. Recordings and Reports pages added to role access diagram
#  12. Tech stack: OpenRouter replaced with Anthropic API
#  13. NEW diagram: Confirmer appointment confirmation workflow
#  14. NEW diagram: Confirmer lifecycle sequence (D-1 trigger → status update in tech calendar)

