```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    %% ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    %% DIAGRAM 3 — Authentication & Call Sequence
    %% FIX 6: Token fetched directly from edge function
    %% FIX 7: Post-call webhook → call_logs + AI summary added
    %% ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    participant User
    participant AuthProvider
    participant Supabase
    participant livekit_token as livekit-token (edge fn)
    participant livekit_webhook as livekit-webhook (edge fn)
    participant ai_call_summary as ai-call-summary (edge fn)
    participant LiveKit
    participant Telnyx
    participant ApiFreeLLM

    User->>AuthProvider: Login
    AuthProvider->>Supabase: Authenticate
    Supabase-->>AuthProvider: Session + Profile + Roles
    AuthProvider-->>User: Auth Context

    User->>Dialer: Open Dialer
    Dialer->>useLiveKitClient: Initialise

    Note over useLiveKitClient,livekit_token: FIX — token fetched directly from edge function,<br/>not routed through a second Supabase hop
    useLiveKitClient->>livekit_token: Invoke edge function (via Supabase Functions client)
    livekit_token->>LiveKit: Request signed room token
    LiveKit-->>livekit_token: Signed JWT
    livekit_token-->>useLiveKitClient: JWT Token

    useLiveKitClient->>LiveKit: Connect to room with token
    LiveKit-->>useLiveKitClient: Connected

    User->>Dialer: Click Call
    Dialer->>useLiveKitClient: Dial number
    useLiveKitClient->>LiveKit: Initiate SIP participant
    LiveKit->>Telnyx: SIP bridge call
    Telnyx-->>LiveKit: Call connected
    LiveKit-->>useLiveKitClient: Call state active
    useLiveKitClient-->>Dialer: Call active

    User->>Dialer: Hang up
    Dialer->>useLiveKitClient: End call
    useLiveKitClient->>LiveKit: Disconnect participant
    LiveKit->>Telnyx: End SIP call
    Telnyx-->>LiveKit: Call ended

    Note over LiveKit,ai_call_summary: FIX — post-call webhook chain now shown
    LiveKit->>livekit_webhook: call.ended event (recording URL, duration, metadata)
    livekit_webhook->>Supabase: Write call_logs, recordings, webhook_events
    livekit_webhook->>ai_call_summary: Trigger AI summarisation
    ai_call_summary->>ApiFreeLLM: Generate summary + transcription
    ApiFreeLLM-->>ai_call_summary: Summary text
    ai_call_summary->>Supabase: Save to ai_call_summaries

    LiveKit-->>useLiveKitClient: Disconnected
    useLiveKitClient-->>Dialer: Call complete
```

