    ManualEntry --> Contact

    %% Campaign routing with DNC gate
    Contact --> Campaign
    Campaign --> DNCCheck
    DNCCheck -->|Listed| DNCBlocked
    DNCCheck -->|Clear| Queue

    %% Calling flow
    Queue --> AgentAssigned
    AgentAssigned --> Call
    Call --> Webhook
    Webhook --> AISummary
    Webhook --> Disposition

    %% Disposition branches
    Disposition -->|Booked| Appointment
    Disposition -->|Callback| Callback
    Disposition -->|No Answer / VM| NoAnswer
    Callback --> Queue
    NoAnswer --> Queue

    %% Appointment → Tech Calendar (immediate)
    Appointment --> TechCalendar

    %% Confirmer workflow (D-1 trigger, separate from tech calendar)
    Appointment --> D1Trigger
    D1Trigger --> ConfirmerQueueEntry
    ConfirmerQueueEntry --> ConfirmAction

    %% Confirmer outcomes — all update status IN the tech calendar, never remove it
    ConfirmAction -->|Confirmed| StatusConfirmed
    ConfirmAction -->|No Answer| StatusNoAnswer
    ConfirmAction -->|Cancelled| StatusCancelled
    ConfirmAction -->|Rescheduled| Rescheduled

    StatusConfirmed --> TechCalendar
    StatusNoAnswer --> TechCalendar
    StatusCancelled --> TechCalendar
    Rescheduled --> Appointment

    %% Delivery
    TechCalendar --> TechDispatched
    TechDispatched --> JobCard
    JobCard --> JobCompleted
```

